WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:14.860
Bobby was shooting hoops with Jason.

2
00:00:14.861 --> 00:00:18.289
He couldn't believe it was the last day of Kids Central.

3
00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:23.210
That meant no more school or Kids Central for an entire summer.

4
00:00:23.211 --> 00:00:28.323
He bet Miss Shelly had something really fun planned for them today.

5
00:00:28.324 --> 00:00:30.688
Miss Shelly blew her whistle.

6
00:00:30.689 --> 00:00:34.017
"Take off your socks and shoes please."

7
00:00:34.018 --> 00:00:38.547
A large map of the United States was on the blacktop.

8
00:00:38.548 --> 00:00:43.240
Next to it were big trays full of paint.

9
00:00:43.241 --> 00:00:47.154
"What's the big map for?" Bobby asked.

10
00:00:47.155 --> 00:00:53.281
"We are going to make a wall map to decorate the gym for next year's Kids Central.

11
00:00:53.282 --> 00:00:58.358
The map will show every state you've been to," Miss Shelly explained.

12
00:00:58.359 --> 00:01:04.362
"Miss Shelly, why did we have to take off our socks and shoes?" Nina asked.

13
00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:09.963
"Because you're going to make a path of footprints to everywhere you've been!"

14
00:01:09.964 --> 00:01:14.038
"We're painting with our feet?" Jason said, excited.

15
00:01:14.039 --> 00:01:17.910
"I can draw with my toes!" Izzie said.

16
00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:21.516
"First you should make a list of everywhere you've been.

17
00:01:21.517 --> 00:01:27.828
So you'll know where to walk on the map," Miss Shelly said.

18
00:01:27.829 --> 00:01:32.586
"I've been to Wisconsin," Izzie said, writing on the easel.

19
00:01:32.587 --> 00:01:39.030
"I think I've been to Florida," Nina said.

20
00:01:39.031 --> 00:01:44.148
"I've been to California!" Bobby said.

21
00:01:44.149 --> 00:01:52.482
"Miss Shelly, how do you spell Michigan?" Jason asked.

22
00:01:52.483 --> 00:01:57.107
When the kids finished making their lists, they were ready to paint.

23
00:01:57.108 --> 00:02:00.054
"Decide which color you want to use.

24
00:02:00.055 --> 00:02:05.716
Once you step in the paint, you can't change your mind," Miss Shelly warned.

25
00:02:05.717 --> 00:02:09.547
"I choose blue!" Bobby said right away.

26
00:02:09.548 --> 00:02:12.795
"I choose yellow," Jason said.

27
00:02:12.796 --> 00:02:16.029
"I'm green!" Izzie cried.

28
00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:19.361
"Purple for me!" said Nina.

29
00:02:19.362 --> 00:02:24.070
"Go ahead and get your feet blue!" Miss Shelly said to Bobby.

30
00:02:24.071 --> 00:02:29.941
"All right!" Bobby jumped into the blue paint tray.

31
00:02:29.942 --> 00:02:34.684
The paint felt cool as it squished between his toes.

32
00:02:34.685 --> 00:02:39.922
"Ha-ha! This feels funny."

33
00:02:39.923 --> 00:02:46.373
"Whoa, you're right," Nina said as she stepped into her tray.

34
00:02:46.374 --> 00:02:50.348
Bobby walked from Pennsylvania all the way to California.

35
00:02:50.349 --> 00:02:54.159
He made footprints straight across the center of the country.

36
00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:58.292
Then he went down to Texas.

37
00:02:58.293 --> 00:03:02.261
His family had only stopped at the airport in Texas.

38
00:03:02.262 --> 00:03:07.992
But he thought that counted.

39
00:03:07.993 --> 00:03:11.684
"I'm finished, Miss Shelly!" Bobby called.

40
00:03:11.685 --> 00:03:14.398
"Me too," Jason said.

41
00:03:14.399 --> 00:03:19.178
"Great. After you wipe your feet, grab some glitter.

42
00:03:19.179 --> 00:03:24.638
You're going to sprinkle it over your favorite place," Miss Shelly said.

43
00:03:24.639 --> 00:03:28.755
"Our favorite place on the map?" Bobby asked.

44
00:03:28.756 --> 00:03:34.201
"Yep. Your favorite place in the country," Miss Shelly said.

45
00:03:34.202 --> 00:03:37.860
Bobby thought as he wiped his feet with a towel.

46
00:03:37.861 --> 00:03:42.337
"Hmm . . ." He whispered something in Jason's ear.

47
00:03:42.338 --> 00:03:44.793
Jason smiled.

48
00:03:44.794 --> 00:03:48.840
Jason told Izzie, and Izzie told Nina.

49
00:03:48.841 --> 00:03:55.970
Then they gathered to sprinkle their glitter over the same spot.

50
00:03:55.971 --> 00:04:02.871
"What's this? Everyone likes Pennsylvania best?" Miss Shelly asked.

51
00:04:02.872 --> 00:04:08.738
"We like Pennsylvania because that's where Kids Central is!" Bobby said.

52
00:04:08.739 --> 00:04:12.847
"And that's where you are too, Miss Shelly," Izzie added.

53
00:04:12.848 --> 00:04:24.481
Miss Shelly smiled. "I'm going to miss you kids this summer!"
